{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45606","headline":"长持经僧 · 贯休","name":"长持经僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"唠唠长夜坐，唠唠早起。\n杉森森，不见长，人声续续如流水。\n摐金挣玉，吐宫咽徵。\n头低草木，手合神鬼。\n日消三两黄金争得止，而槁木朽枝，一食而已。\n伤嗟浮世之人，善事不曾入耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}